sentences.text:
11. Accordingly, the following order:
NC: 2025:KHC-K:6550 C/W MFA.CROB No. 200011 of 2019 HC-KAR ORDER (i) MFA No.202158/2018 is allowed in part;
(ii) MFA Crob No.200011/2019 is also partly allowed;
(iii) The claimants are entitled for total compensation of Rs.5,90,100/- along with interest at the rate of 6% per annum from 08.08.2011 till the date of realization as against Rs.3,61,000/-
awarded by the tribunal;
(iv) The Insurance company is directed to deposit the enhanced compensation of Rs.5,90,100/-
along with interest at the rate of 6% interest per annum from 08.08.2011 within a period of one month;

